{
  "status": "placeholder",
  "note": "Version 2 onboarding (M-1.8) — exact branches from Genesis Health (2).pdf Health Intake Logic wrt Age & Gender. Mandatory: Age (full date of birth: day, month, year) + Sex at birth + Gender identity. Female/non-binary/intersex 13+: periodsStarted → pubertyBlockers → reproductive banks. Peri/post/surgical open hrtStatus (Yes / Yes Previously expand inline hrtType pills; No skips type/taken) → hrtTaken. Post asks ageAtLastPeriod; surgical asks hysterectomy + ovariesRemoved. Pre goes straight to meds. Transgender: one puberty question (Trans-woman / Trans-man). Wording is placeholder pending Deborah.",
